{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22141","headline":"效陶潜体诗十六首 十二 · 白居易","name":"效陶潜体诗十六首 十二","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"吾闻浔阳郡，昔有陶徵君。\n爱酒不爱名，忧醒不忧贫。\n尝爲彭泽令，在官才八旬。\n愀然忽不乐，挂印着公门。\n口吟归去来，头戴漉酒巾。\n人吏留不得，直入故山云。\n归来五柳下，还以酒养真。\n人间荣与利，摆落如泥尘。\n先生去已久，纸墨有遗文。\n篇篇劝我饮，此外无所云。\n我从老大来，窃慕其爲人。\n其他不可及，且傚醉昏昏。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22141.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22141","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}